cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BLS Image Analyzer in your research, please cite this software."
title: "BLS Image Analyzer"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Pawar"
    given-names: "Tapish"

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-08-23"

abstract: >-
  BLS Image Analyzer is an R-based image phenotyping pipeline
  for semi-automated assessment of bacterial leaf streak symptoms
  from leaf images. The software performs leaf segmentation,
  RGB-to-HSV color analysis, pixel-based classification of healthy,
  chlorotic, and necrotic tissue, estimation of diseased leaf area,
  and conversion of image-derived disease severity to a 1-9 rating.
  It also generates classification overlays, diagnostic figures,
  tabular outputs, and compiled PDF reports.

keywords:
  - bacterial leaf streak
  - BLS
  - image phenotyping
  - plant disease
  - wheat
  - image analysis
  - disease severity
  - R
  - plant pathology

